#
# ========================================
# OVERSIZED VALUE REJECTION
# ========================================
#
#
# Test 1: SET value at the limit (512000 bytes) must succeed
#
+OK
#
# Test 2: SET value one byte over the limit (512001 bytes) must be rejected
#
-ERR value too large
#
# Test 3: Server stays alive after rejected oversized SET
#
PONG
#
# ========================================
# SELECT OUT-OF-BOUNDS
# ========================================
#
#
# Test 4: SELECT 0 (valid database) must succeed
#
+OK
#
# Test 5: SELECT 999 (out of range) must be rejected
#
-ERR DB index is out of range
#
# Test 6: SELECT -1 (negative index) must be rejected
#
-ERR DB index is out of range
#
# Test 7: SELECT non-integer argument must be rejected
#
-ERR Wrong parameter to SELECT command
#
# Test 8: Server stays alive after all out-of-bounds SELECT commands
#
PONG
#
# ========================================
# CLEANUP
# ========================================
#
